    english_customer_response_template: 'Hi {{USERNAME}}, your computer was signing you in with a temporary profile, which is why your desktop looked empty and your icons seemed gone. Your files were never deleted: they were kept in your original profile folder. We repaired the Windows profile entry, restored your desktop, documents and downloads, and confirmed that two restarts later your session opens normally with everything in place. Please check your desktop and your usual folders now. If Windows ever shows "preparing Windows" for a long time again, stop and reply to ticket {{TICKET_ID}} instead of saving new work, so we can fix the profile before anything is written to a temporary copy.',
