    english_customer_response_template: 'Hi {{USERNAME}}, after the recent update your computer was failing to start correctly. We started Windows in Safe Mode, which loads only essential drivers, and confirmed the problem disappeared there. We then restored the system to a restore point taken before the issue began. Your personal files and documents were not touched; however, any applications installed after that restore point may need to be installed again. We verified Windows starts normally and we re-enabled automatic protection so future restore points are created. If the problem reappears, reply to ticket {{TICKET_ID}} and mention what changed right before it started.',
